              <li>
                <strong>Company &amp; Corporate Events:</strong> Employee onboarding kits, corporate retreats, and conferences — professional apparel that looks as sharp in the office as it does offsite.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>School &amp; Spirit Wear:</strong> Student councils, clubs, spirit weeks, and class trips — durable shirts mixing youth and adult sizing so the entire school matches.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Sports Teams &amp; Leagues:</strong> Tough enough for practice drills, sharp enough for travel days — personalize with custom rosters and numbers.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Nonprofits &amp; Fundraisers:</strong> High-impact, giveaway-friendly merchandise that supporters are eager to wear — priced to support organizational budgets.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Family Reunions &amp; Life Events:</strong> A shared graphic with a family surname or milestone year turns any gathering into an unforgettable memory.
              </li>
              <li>
