              How much does a custom t-shirt cost?
            </button>
            <div class="pc-Faqs-faq-answer" style="display: block;">
              <p>
                The cost depends on the garment style you choose, print placements, and the quantity you order. The more shirts you order, the lower your price per shirt. With SwiftBay Prints all-inclusive pricing, you will always see your exact total before you buy — no hidden setup fees or surprise charges.
              </p>
