              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- FAQ 7 -->
          <div class="pc-Faqs-faq">
            <button type="button" class="pc-Faqs-faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
              What are some tips for designing a high-quality t-shirt?
            </button>
            <div class="pc-Faqs-faq-answer" style="display: none;">
              <p>
                Use high-contrast color combinations (for example, light graphics on dark shirts or dark graphics on light shirts), keep text legible from a few feet away, and upload high-resolution files (300 DPI or vector formats) to ensure crisp print edges.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- FAQ 8 -->
          <div class="pc-Faqs-faq">
            <button type="button" class="pc-Faqs-faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
              What kinds of events can I order custom t-shirts for?
