          <!-- FAQ 9 -->
          <div class="pc-Faqs-faq">
            <button type="button" class="pc-Faqs-faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
              Can I choose between digital printing and screen printing?
            </button>
            <div class="pc-Faqs-faq-answer" style="display: none;">
              <p>
                Yes. We utilize advanced Direct-to-Film (DTF) digital printing for multi-color, photo-realistic, or single-shirt orders, and screen printing for high-volume bulk runs. We will always ensure your design is paired with the best technique for durability and value.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- FAQ 10 -->
          <div class="pc-Faqs-faq">
            <button type="button" class="pc-Faqs-faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
              What file types work best for uploading artwork for my shirt design?
