                Vector files (SVG, AI, EPS, PDF) produce the sharpest results at any size. High-resolution PNG files with transparent backgrounds (at least 300 DPI) also work excellently. If you are unsure about your file format, upload your file and our design specialists will review it.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- FAQ 11 -->
          <div class="pc-Faqs-faq">
            <button type="button" class="pc-Faqs-faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
              What happens after I place my custom shirt order?
            </button>
